WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:05.679
Lab 1 runs in the privileged-access
folder, in one PowerShell 7 session,

3
00:00:05.679 --> 00:00:09.400
because step six uses a
variable that step four loads.

4
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.310
Step one tests Microsoft's Conditional
Access template as published,

5
00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:16.613
the one the Graph reference
returns for getting a template.

6
00:00:16.613 --> 00:00:18.113
Seven tests pass.

7
00:00:18.113 --> 00:00:23.063
Step two loads the Conditional Access
module and lists each task's permissions.

8
00:00:23.063 --> 00:00:27.565
To read and plan, three: Authentication
Context dot Read dot All,

9
00:00:27.565 --> 00:00:32.587
Policy dot Read dot All, and Policy
dot Read dot Authentication Method.

10
00:00:32.587 --> 00:00:37.356
To apply, the same three, plus two
writes: Authentication Context dot

11
00:00:37.356 --> 00:00:42.124
ReadWrite dot All, and Policy dot
ReadWrite dot Conditional Access.

12
00:00:42.124 --> 00:00:43.200
Nothing else.
